  "semantics": "Proposal pending owner approval; not current runtime support. Ordered scalar variables in expression mode; integer/real/string/boolean/datetime/variant. Native Loginom 7.4.2 uses bare earlier names such as base+1, not Expr./Field. Intermediate expressions feed later expressions but are excluded from output variables 0. Preserve unlisted expressions and order; new-node defaults intermediate=false. Civil datetime preserves milliseconds without UTC conversion. Variant retains declared variant type and runtime value subtype. Execute/read variable_ports:[0], ports:[], Save separately. Cache and JavaScript were not found in this wizard; replacement and reorder remain unverified.",
